[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]3.  [color=#000000]曹叡问答[/color]：嘉靖本有曹叡先问"朕未知其详，卿试言之"一轮；毛本删去[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]4.  [color=#000000]"铜人眼中"[/color]：毛本增"眼中"二字（潸然泪下→眼中潸然泪下）[/indent]
